flowchart TB
  O["/goal objective<br/>Soldier inspects project and proposes approach"]
  P["Navigator builds contract<br/>Host validates DAG; Wizard audits plan"]
  A["Owner reviews commands<br/>/goal approve — default consent path"]
  B["Host runs gate/proof baselines<br/>Red or green are observations"]
  E["Soldier executes NEXT ACTION<br/>Host gate; Wizard node review if gate passes"]
  F["Host reruns every gate and locked proof<br/>Fresh Wizard final review if all pass"]
  D["VERIFIED complete<br/>Scholar lesson is advisory after acceptance"]
  R["Priest diagnoses a red outcome<br/>Bounded recovery; no self-certification"]
  H["Planning/task advice: retry relevant action<br/>Unpassed-gate amendment: Wizard audit + renewed approval/baselines<br/>Owner-only need: pause for owner"]
  N["Cloud roles use Pi provider registry<br/>Errors, cancellation or exhausted limits pause<br/>Trusted-project CI consent is an explicit opt-in"]
  O --> P --> A --> B --> E
  E -->|"Accepted node; more ready nodes"| E
  E -->|"All nodes accepted"| F
  F -->|"Every rerun green; final review accepts"| D
  P -->|"Plan rejected"| R
  E -->|"Gate/review red or worker blocked"| R
  F -->|"Rerun/final review red"| R
  R --> H
  classDef role fill:#eef2ff,stroke:#4338ca,color:#172554
  classDef host fill:#eff6ff,stroke:#1d4ed8,color:#172554
  classDef consent fill:#fff7ed,stroke:#9a3412,color:#431407
  classDef recover fill:#fff1f2,stroke:#9f1239,color:#4c0519
  classDef done fill:#ecfdf5,stroke:#047857,color:#064e3b
  class O,P role
  class B,E,F,N host
  class A consent
  class R,H recover
  class D done
